  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citizen Service Efficiency Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Eficiencia al Servicio del Ciudadano</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Gobierno pretende, sobre la base de un enfoque innovador, incrementar la eficiencia, eficacia y transparencia de la Administracin Pblica Nacional, a travs de una serie de reformas transversales identificadas como prioritarias.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Goverment intends, based on an innovative approach, to increase the efficiency, effectiveness and transparency in public administration, through a series of cross-cutting reforms identified as priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
